From 0146000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GCSA Aegis <aegis@gcsa.local>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 03:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(aegis): gate process-backed ServiceWorker script traffic

---
diff --git a/chrome/browser/aegis/access/access_proxying_url_loader_factory.cc b/chrome/browser/aegis/access/access_proxying_url_loader_factory.cc
